  "description": "<Note>If the user includes stop code in the Transactional SMS, then it will be switched to Marketing SMS automatically and it will be interpreted as a Marketing SMS. To send Transactional SMS as Transactional, it is important not to use stop code. Note: For adding a stop code, client has to add reply STOP to [STOP_CODE] and the [STOP_CODE] will be replaced with the number.</Note> <Note title=\"For end users in France\">Transactional SMS can be sent at any time without time restrictions. However, if a message is categorized as Marketing, it must adhere to specific time restrictions. Messages sent",
